<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market supplied by Khanani &amp; Kalia International:</p>
<p>			     Buying rate	   Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	  39.15		   39.20</p>
<p>    Pound sterling     61.10		   61.20</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	26.40		   26.45</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	  0.358		   0.360</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	  10.43		   10.45</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	   10.66		   10.68</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	  1.05		    1.07</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		9.60 pct		9.80 pct</p>
</text>
